[2026-06-01 08:57:36] [CMD] browseros-cli fill -p 296 2014 Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🦐 1 lb jumbo shrimp, 🍗 4 cups chicken stock, 🍋 3 stalks lemongrass, 🫚 1 inch galangal, 🍋 5 kaffir lime leaves, 🍅 3 tbsp fish sauce, 🍋 2 tbsp lime juice, 🌶️ 1 tbsp Thai chili paste (Nam Prik Pao), and straw mushrooms. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Bring stock to a boil. 🥣 Add smashed lemongrass, galangal, and lime leaves; simmer for 5 mins. 🔥 Add mushrooms and shrimp; cook until shrimp turn pink. ⏲️ Remove from heat and stir in chili paste, fish sauce, and lime juice. 🍳 Do not boil after adding lime juice. 🔪 Garnish with fresh cilantro and bird's eye chilies.
#tomyum #thaifood #spicy #soup #healthy #asiancuisine #shrimpsoup #thai 🌮🍱
