Caption: 🧈 Garlic Butter Broiled Lobster Tail 🫒
Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🦞 2 large lobster tails, 🧈 4 tbsp melted butter, 🧄 1 clove minced garlic, 🌶️ 1/2 tsp smoked paprika, 🍋 1 tsp fresh lemon juice, 🌿 and parsley. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Butterfly the tails by cutting down the center of the top shell and pulling the meat upward to rest on top. 🥣 Mix butter, garlic, paprika, and lemon; brush onto the meat. 🔥 Broil at 450°F (230°C) for 12-15 minutes until the meat is white and opaque. ⏲️ Garnish with parsley and serve with extra drawn butter.
#lobster #seafood #luxuryfood #dinner #cooking #butter #lobsterlover #gourmet 🌮🍱'
