[2026-06-01 09:03:22] [CMD] browseros-cli fill -p 304 2015 Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🥖 1 pack ladyfingers, ☕ 2 cups strong espresso (cooled), 16oz mascarpone, 🥚 3 large eggs (separated), 🍬 1/2 cup sugar, 🥃 2 tbsp dark rum (optional), 🍫 and dark cocoa powder. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Whisk egg yolks and sugar until pale; fold in mascarpone. 🥣 In a separate bowl, whisk egg whites to stiff peaks and fold into the cream. 🔥 Quickly dip ladyfingers in espresso/rum and layer in a dish. ⏲️ Spread half the cream. 🍳 Repeat layers. 🔪 Dust heavily with cocoa powder. 🥧 Refrigerate for at least 6 hours (ideally overnight) to set.
#tiramisu #dessert #italianfood #sweet #cake #coffee #coffeelover #nobake 🌮🍱
