Steps: 👨‍🍳 Whisk dry ingredients in one bowl and wet ingredients in another. 🥣 Gently fold the wet into the dry (don't overmix; lumps are okay). 🔥 Let the batter rest for 10 minutes. ⏲️ Cook on a buttered griddle over medium heat until bubbles form on top. 🍳 Flip and cook until golden. 🔪 Serve stacked high with syrup and butter.
