[2026-06-01 09:09:10] [CMD] browseros-cli fill -p 312 2032 Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🍝 1 lb potato gnocchi, 🌿 1 cup fresh basil leaves, 🧀 1/2 cup parmesan, 🥜 1/3 cup pine nuts, 🧄 2 cloves garlic, 🫒 1/2 cup olive oil. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Pulse basil, nuts, garlic, and cheese in a processor while drizzling in olive oil to make pesto. 🥣 Boil gnocchi in salted water until they float to the surface (about 2 mins). 🔥 Drain, but reserve a splash of water. ⏲️ Toss the hot gnocchi with the pesto and water in a bowl until coated. 🍳 Top with more parmesan and toasted pine nuts.
#gnocchi #pesto #italianfood #vegetarian #dinner #pasta #basil #fresh 🌮🍱
