[2026-06-01 09:14:58] [CMD] browseros-cli fill -p 320 2032 Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🥩 4 lamb rib chops, 🧄 2 cloves minced garlic, 🌿 1 tbsp chopped fresh rosemary, 🌿 1 tsp thyme, 🫒 2 tbsp olive oil, 🧂 salt and pepper. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Rub the chops with oil, garlic, and herbs; let marinate for 30 mins. 🥣 Heat a heavy skillet until smoking. 🔥 Sear the chops for 3-4 mins per side for medium-rare. ⏲️ Make sure to sear the fat cap on the side until crispy. 🍳 Let the meat rest for 5 minutes before serving with a squeeze of lemon or a red wine reduction.
#lambchops #meat #dinner #cooking #finedining #rosemary #gourmet #lamb 🌮🍱
