Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🦐 1/2 lb chopped shrimp, 🎋 1/4 cup minced bamboo shoots, 🫒 1 tsp sesame oil, 🫚 1 tsp ginger. Wrapper: 1 cup wheat starch, 🌽 1/2 cup cornstarch, 🫒 boiling water. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Mix shrimp with bamboo and seasonings. 🥣 Make the dough by adding boiling water to the starches; knead until smooth. 🔥 Roll into thin circles. ⏲️ Place a spoonful of shrimp in the center and fold into a crescent with 7-10 pleats. 🍳 Steam on a piece of parchment for 6-8 minutes until the skin becomes translucent.
#hargow #dimsum #dumplings #chinesefood #shrimp #healthy #asiancuisine #dimsumtime 🌮🍱'
