Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🐷 5 lb pork shoulder (boston butt), 1/2 cup BBQ rub, 🍅 1 cup tangy vinegar BBQ sauce, 🥗 1 cup creamy coleslaw, and 4 large potato buns. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Rub the pork and let sit overnight. 🥣 Smoke at 250°F (120°C) for 8-10 hours until the internal temp is 200°F. 🔥 Wrap in foil for the last 2 hours. ⏲️ Let the meat rest for 1 hour, then shred with two forks. 🍳 Toss with BBQ sauce. 🔪 Pile high on toasted potato buns and top with cold, crunchy coleslaw.
